  "content": "<h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 超過100個任務</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 完全重構的世界生成（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes o' Plenty</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 完全最佳化</strong>&nbsp;</h5><h5><strong>✔️ 自訂<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.horizon.pics%252f39d7ccdc-f694-466a-832b-027a84051a8f%253fa%253d580%2526mime1%253dimage%2526mime2%253dpng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">光影預設</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 包含1.20.2+的內容（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Backport</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 重製的終界要塞與堡壘</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 新增頭目與生物（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mowzies-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mowzie's Mobs</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cataclysm</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 數千個新增地牢與結構（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorabuild-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdoraBuild: Structures</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">天域</a>維度，附帶眾多調整與新增內容（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Redux</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Villages</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 生活品質功能，如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">傳送石</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-tome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">經驗書</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero的小地圖</a>，附帶額外功能</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">可騎乘的龍</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 許多自訂功能，提升遊戲體驗</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 內建<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tLTC6wYcWVM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">免費世界共享</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f64026%252fbetter-mc-forge-bmc4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">350+ 模組</a></strong></h5><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/z-IddtxivNA\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SV_SKlxNEUM\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>非官方MINECRAFT產品。未經MOJANG或MICROSOFT批准或與其相關</strong></span></h5>",
